WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.739
Actual local console session with synthetic records.

00:00:03.739 --> 00:00:08.813
A read-only service requested a close. Policy denied it. The local ticket remained open.

00:00:08.813 --> 00:00:12.652
Another service holds the close grant. Its request now requires human approval.

00:00:12.652 --> 00:00:16.747
Test automation uses a separate reviewer account to check the action and target.

00:00:16.747 --> 00:00:21.961
The test confirms using that account. The local ticket closes once, moving from revision 0 to 1.

00:00:21.961 --> 00:00:26.747
The first organization can verify and retrieve the run evidence.

00:00:26.747 --> 00:00:32.000
A separate organization sees its own records. The first report returns HTTP 404 for its account.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Project by Meshal Almasoudi & Fahad Mubarak.
